      "html": "<p>Nangra assamensis Sen &amp; Biswas, 1994. Family Sisoridae. Maximum size 92 mm SL. IUCN status: Least Concern (last assessed 2009).</p><p>Type locality: Brahmaputra River at Neematighat, 14 kilometres from Jorhat, Assam, India.</p>"
    },
