      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1415",
      "html": "<p>Asia: India. Found in North Eastern India waters (Padma, Jamuna, Brahmaputra), the Ganges and Bengal waters including West Bengal.</p>"
    },
